   "source": [
    "# Step 1 — Hand-tune the supra-threshold ERP\n",
    "\n",
    "First stage of the ERP tuning pipeline for the `duecker_ET_model`:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Step 1 — hand-tune (this notebook):** manually set the evoked-drive timing and\n",
    "   synaptic weights until the simulated dipole qualitatively matches the measured ERP.\n",
    "   This provides the starting point for the optimiser.\n",
    "2. **Step 2 — optimise (`optim_ERP_cma.py`):** refine those drive parameters with\n",
    "   CMA-ES against the experimental waveform (run on the cluster via `optim_ERP_cma.sh`).\n",
    "3. **Step 3 — inspect results (`optim_ERP_results.ipynb`):** load the optimiser\n",
    "   checkpoint and analyse the fitted ERP.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target:** the S1 supra-threshold (detected) MEG ERP, `data/hnn-data/MEG_detection_data/S1_SupraT.txt`.\n"
   ]
  },
